  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.10.0: Convention-based scanning via [assembly: AutoWireScan(\"MyApp.Services\")] — scan whole namespaces without per-class attributes. [AutoWireExclude] to opt out. 1.9.0: Profile property + new icon. 1.8.0: Ordered decorator stacking. 1.7.0: AW004 captive dependency diagnostic. 1.6.0: IncludeSelf. 1.5.0: [HostedService] + AW003. 1.4.0: Decorators. 1.3.0: AllowMultiple, DuplicateStrategy, TryX. 1.2.0: Open generics. 1.0.0: Initial release.",
